B.TS=new A.aN("Meelte was born from a simple everyday experience.\n\nWhile browsing a social platform, I came across an attractive product offer that caught my attention. Before I could learn more, I received a phone call. By the time the call ended, the advertisement had disappeared and I was unable to find it again. I regretted answering the call and realised how easily valuable opportunities can be lost in the fast-moving digital world.\n\nAt another point, while travelling to a new city, I found it difficult to connect with people who shared my language, culture, and interests. Despite being surrounded by thousands of people, meaningful connections were hard to find.\n\nThese experiences inspired the creation of Meelte \u2014 a platform designed to help people discover opportunities, local products, meaningful events, and communities without missing what matters most to them.\n\nOur goal is simple: help people connect with the right opportunities and the right people at the right time.",null,B.bx,null,null)
